**Key Achievements (Target):**
- ⚡ Reduce threat detection time: 200+ days → <30 minutes
- 💰 Cost reduction: 90% vs commercial solutions
- 🎯 90%+ detection rate with ML-powered analysis
- 🔄 Automated incident response workflows

